pi-deepseek-router is an independent Pi port/adaptation of routing concepts and
selected logic from yjh051108/dsh-router-standard (MIT):
https://github.com/yjh051108/dsh-router-standard

The following logic was referenced and adapted for this project:
- the keyword/task classifier (build vs fix vs inspect task bands)
- the behavior band model (spec / mixed / react / weak)
- the persona and guidance semantics attached to each band

